<title>USA: AnnTaylor Stores stake cut by Cygne.</title>
<headline>AnnTaylor Stores stake cut by Cygne.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cygne Designs Inc said Tuesday it cut its stake in AnnTaylor Stores Corp to 1,839,145 common shares or 7.2 percent of the outstanding class.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Cygne said its latest transactions include the sale of 509,000 common shares from Oct 23 to Oct 28 at prices ranging from $17.75 to $17.875 per share.</p>
</text>
